# NEW IN 3.0 - 10/27/2025
###########################
# AUTO FIGHT / AUTO TARGET TOGGLE
# - mconfig_Bot_FightAutoTarget 1 = Auto target (original behavior)
# - mconfig_Bot_FightAutoTarget 0 = Do not auto target
#  -- If you use 0, make sure to set a hotkey in Razor for
#  -- Set Last Target and/or Target Closest Non-Friendly Monster
#  -- The script needs to see the target in RAZOR to use pots and abilities.
@setvar! mconfig_Bot_FightAutoTarget 1

# Peace mode vs war mode 0 = war  1 = peace to fight mobs automatically
@setvar! mconfig_Bot_FightInPeaceMode 0

